# Welcome

This is the documentation for **{{projectName}}** — a ticketing system built on
the [Frappe Framework](https://frappeframework.com){{#if withHelpdesk}} and
[Frappe Helpdesk](https://github.com/frappe/helpdesk){{/if}}, scaffolded with
[`dude`](https://github.com/cubocicloide/dude).

Beyond running out of the box, this project is a **worked example of Frappe's
core building blocks**: the custom app `apps/ticketing/` demonstrates DocTypes,
controllers, form scripts, portal pages, whitelisted APIs, scheduled tasks,
document-event hooks, workflows and fixtures. The
[Frappe core concepts](frappe.md) page walks through each one, and
[Extending the app](extending.md) is the "how do I add X?" cookbook.

