## Quick links

Once `dude up` reports the bench running (`dude logs --service bench` shows
`bench start`), open:

| Resource | URL | Credentials / notes |
|----------|-----|---------------------|
| Desk (admin UI) | <http://{{projectName}}.localhost:8000/app> | `Administrator` / `admin` |
{{#if withHelpdesk}}
| Helpdesk (agent UI) | <http://{{projectName}}.localhost:8000/helpdesk> | same login |
{{/if}}
| Example portal page | <http://{{projectName}}.localhost:8000/ticket_stats> | public web page from `apps/ticketing` |
| Example API method | <http://{{projectName}}.localhost:8000/api/method/ticketing.api.ticket_stats> | whitelisted RPC endpoint |
| This docs site | <http://localhost:8001> | `dude docs` |

!!! note "`*.localhost`"
    Modern browsers resolve `*.localhost` to `127.0.0.1` automatically. If a
    tool of yours can't, add `127.0.0.1 {{projectName}}.localhost` to `/etc/hosts`.

