## Tech stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Framework | Frappe Framework v15 (Python) — bench, Desk, website engine |
{{#if withHelpdesk}}
| Ticketing UI | Frappe Helpdesk (`HD Ticket` and friends) |
{{/if}}
| Custom app | `apps/ticketing/` — DocTypes, hooks, tasks, API, portal pages |
| Database | MariaDB 10.6 |
| Cache / queue | Redis (separate cache and queue instances) |
| Infra | Docker Compose (`mariadb`, `redis-cache`, `redis-queue`, `bench`) |
| Testing | `bench run-tests` (FrappeTestCase) via `dude test` |
| Formatting | ruff (Frappe style — tabs) via `dude format` |
| Docs | MkDocs Material |
